WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.960
[The Heir]

01:35.380 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 22]

01:46.200 --> 01:49.039
The Tribute Ink selection begins now.

01:49.120 --> 01:52.479
Candidates, please enter the venue
in an orderly manner.

01:55.039 --> 01:56.640
Please let me through.

02:01.790 --> 02:02.640
Master Qi.

02:03.870 --> 02:04.590
Zhengshen,

02:05.560 --> 02:06.690
why don't you get in?

02:07.280 --> 02:08.910
I'd rather stay outside.

02:09.360 --> 02:12.680
Don't you want to watch your father fight
for the authority over the Tribute Ink?

02:12.680 --> 02:14.210
But it's against the rules.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.030
Against the rules?

02:18.510 --> 02:19.470
When you're in there,

02:19.470 --> 02:21.000
you just need to obey the rules inside.

02:21.000 --> 02:21.560
Let's go.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.430
Master Qi, it...

02:22.430 --> 02:23.030
Just go.

02:24.050 --> 02:26.880
[Rushi House]

02:27.590 --> 02:30.780
[Tingmo Pavilion]

02:30.800 --> 02:32.260
[Jiangu House]

02:46.360 --> 02:48.280
The primary selection is complete.

02:48.280 --> 02:50.150
The Scholar Ink by the Chen family,

02:50.150 --> 02:52.240
The ancient lacquer-soot ink
by the Li family,

02:52.240 --> 02:54.910
and the Ziji Dragon Light Ink
by the Tian family are admitted

02:54.910 --> 02:55.710
to the finals!

02:56.000 --> 02:57.870
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

03:09.080 --> 03:11.280
What kind of ink are you presenting?

03:13.430 --> 03:15.630
The Chen family presents the Cloud Ink.

03:16.030 --> 03:17.290
The Li family presents

03:17.840 --> 03:18.840
the Origin Ink.

03:19.520 --> 03:22.980
The Tian family presents
the Jin Zhangzong Round Scented Ink.

03:23.150 --> 03:25.750
As expected,
they had another plan in reserve.

03:30.840 --> 03:32.800
Examiners, please test the ink.

03:54.170 --> 03:56.210
[Ink examiner, Mr. Fengzhou]

04:51.390 --> 04:53.040
The Chen family must have made use of

04:53.040 --> 04:56.000
the formulas of tung oil soot
and lacquer soot for the Cloud Ink.

04:56.000 --> 04:58.860
The ink yields a dense black
with luminous clarity.

04:59.950 --> 05:02.040
In particular, the light ink areas

05:02.240 --> 05:03.700
display distinct layers.

05:03.750 --> 05:06.750
Each tone holds its place perfectly

05:06.870 --> 05:08.070
without bleeding.

05:09.720 --> 05:10.720
It is excellent.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.460
Gentlemen,

05:15.710 --> 05:19.130
what do you think of the ink
presented by the Tian family?

05:20.950 --> 05:22.480
The Round Scented Ink truly

05:22.680 --> 05:24.210
lives up to its reputation.

05:24.390 --> 05:26.040
It's aromatic but not overwhelming,

05:26.040 --> 05:28.970
so it helps to calm the mind
when one writes or paints.

05:29.070 --> 05:30.600
It performs even better

05:30.830 --> 05:32.240
as it's applied to paper.

05:32.740 --> 05:34.810
The ink takes a deep and steady tone,

05:34.870 --> 05:37.390
yet never feels heavy or stifling—

05:38.390 --> 05:39.650
rich but not sluggish.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.830
It's of premium quality.

05:51.010 --> 05:53.250
The Origin Ink is a continuation

05:53.280 --> 05:55.750
of the Li family's
best pine soot ink formula.

05:55.750 --> 05:58.870
Needless to say,
this is fine piece of ink.

05:59.830 --> 06:00.870
However,

06:01.310 --> 06:03.110
pardon me for being inadequate,

06:04.120 --> 06:06.270
as I really cannot find

06:06.720 --> 06:09.160
anything special about it.

06:10.390 --> 06:11.560
The pigment

06:12.000 --> 06:14.560
is indeed more delicate and translucent.

06:14.920 --> 06:17.630
But it only reflects ordinary progress

06:17.630 --> 06:19.870
in materials and techniques.

06:19.920 --> 06:22.560
The best of pine soot is not brought out.

06:22.800 --> 06:27.040
This ink can barely hold a candle to that
presented by the Tian and Chen families.

06:27.040 --> 06:28.390
The two ink examiners of you

06:28.390 --> 06:30.750
are both leading figures
in the literary and art circles.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.950
You made a fair judgement.

06:31.950 --> 06:32.800
Li Ink...

06:34.390 --> 06:35.990
accepts it wholeheartedly.

06:36.159 --> 06:38.420
The Li family's ink is rated as grade one.

06:38.510 --> 06:39.920
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

06:40.000 --> 06:41.000
Bravo!

06:41.270 --> 06:42.240
Bravo!

06:42.270 --> 06:44.560
The Tian family's ink
is rated as supreme grade.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.950
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

06:46.750 --> 06:49.159
The Tian family's ink
is also rated as supreme grade.

06:49.159 --> 06:50.120
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

06:50.820 --> 06:52.970
[Li's Ancestral Hall]

06:53.830 --> 06:54.870
Here they come.

06:59.680 --> 07:00.390
Zhen.

07:00.390 --> 07:01.120
Eldest Aunt.

07:01.830 --> 07:04.790
I figured Eighth Uncle would be reluctant
to come to the ancestral hall.

07:04.790 --> 07:07.430
So I arranged the items you asked for
right here.

07:07.430 --> 07:08.600
Does this seem alright to you?

07:08.600 --> 07:10.860
How very thoughtful of you, Eldest Aunt.

07:11.730 --> 07:13.460
Is my grandfather not here yet?

07:14.480 --> 07:15.340
He is arriving.

07:17.680 --> 07:19.810
-Eighth Master Li.
-Eighth Master Li.

07:23.960 --> 07:26.420
The auspicious hour is upon us.
Let's begin.

07:30.430 --> 07:32.560
I, Li Zhen, master of Li Ink, have brought

07:32.560 --> 07:35.390
all members of the clan to pay respects
to the Li ancestors.

07:35.390 --> 07:37.800
In today's Tribute Ink selection,

07:38.040 --> 07:40.840
the Origin Ink we presented was rated
as grade one.

07:41.159 --> 07:44.159
It will be now offered here
by its maker, Li Jingdong.

08:03.120 --> 08:05.250
This unworthy descendant Li Jingdong

08:06.310 --> 08:07.900
is a poorly educated man

08:08.800 --> 08:10.390
of mediocracy.

08:10.950 --> 08:14.280
Despite years of learning,
my skills are still inadequate.

08:14.360 --> 08:17.240
For the first time, I entered my creation
into the Tribute Ink Selection.

08:17.240 --> 08:18.920
Yet I failed and returned

08:19.480 --> 08:21.120
in defeat.

08:21.630 --> 08:22.600
I, Jingdong,

08:23.270 --> 08:25.070
has let down Li Ink

08:25.680 --> 08:27.270
and my late father.

08:28.360 --> 08:30.870
Deeply ashamed of myself,

08:32.080 --> 08:34.120
I'm feeling utterly disgraced.

08:39.390 --> 08:40.510
Uncle Jingdong.

08:41.510 --> 08:43.710
Please get up, Uncle Jingdong. Come on.

08:46.600 --> 08:47.630
Get up now.

08:52.550 --> 08:53.360
Grandfather.

08:54.210 --> 08:56.120
When you attended
the Tribute Ink selection

08:56.120 --> 08:58.850
with the Sixth and Seventh Grandfathers
for the first time,

08:58.850 --> 09:00.440
what grade was your ink rated?

09:00.440 --> 09:01.910
Our ink couldn't even reach

09:01.910 --> 09:03.910
grade one in our first competition.

09:05.750 --> 09:06.720
Uncle Jingdong,

09:07.150 --> 09:10.150
your ink was rated as grade one
in your first Tribute Ink selection.

09:10.150 --> 09:13.360
You're starting from a better place
than my grandfather and his brothers.

09:13.360 --> 09:15.160
When Li Ink was in grave trouble,

09:15.200 --> 09:17.750
you bravely assumed
all challenging responsibilities.

09:17.750 --> 09:18.510
Li Ink

09:18.970 --> 09:19.890
is proud of you.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.000
Please get up.

09:29.910 --> 09:30.480
Father.

09:41.750 --> 09:42.950
Everyone, do you know

09:43.390 --> 09:45.080
why I named this ink

09:45.440 --> 09:46.790
the Origin Ink?

09:48.670 --> 09:51.840
It stems from "Yuan," one of
the four virtues of the Qian hexagram.

09:51.840 --> 09:53.170
It stands for a new start

09:53.270 --> 09:54.320
after an ending.

09:55.150 --> 09:57.280
The Tribute Ink case 13 years ago still

09:58.000 --> 10:00.330
aches the heart of everyone present here.

10:00.840 --> 10:03.040
Li Ink plummeted to the bottom due to it.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.510
But now, the Origin Ink

10:06.480 --> 10:08.340
has brought upon us a fresh start.

10:09.000 --> 10:12.200
The Li family entered the Origin Ink
into the just finished

10:12.200 --> 10:13.960
Tribute Ink selection

10:14.080 --> 10:15.750
exactly because this ink

10:15.910 --> 10:17.310
is the result of every Li member's

10:17.310 --> 10:18.390
hard work.

10:19.200 --> 10:20.670
Nothing but the Origin Ink

10:21.200 --> 10:23.360
can stop our hearts from aching again.

10:26.390 --> 10:27.390
I firmly believe

10:27.840 --> 10:29.720
that as long as we make concerted efforts,

10:29.720 --> 10:32.510
Li Ink will regain its glory one day.

10:33.670 --> 10:36.910
The creation of the Origin Ink
is attributed to all of us.

10:37.550 --> 10:39.680
Li Ink couldn't have gained a new start

10:39.840 --> 10:41.840
without everyone present.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.460
Hereby, I, Li Zhen, extend

10:44.510 --> 10:46.310
sincere gratitude to all of you.

10:55.200 --> 10:56.550
What exactly is going on?

10:56.550 --> 10:57.960
The sun is about to set,

10:57.960 --> 10:59.550
but there isn't a result yet.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.880
-That's right.
-Right.

11:01.150 --> 11:02.950
The selection is taking so long.

11:07.390 --> 11:08.150
Everyone,

11:10.480 --> 11:11.790
it's getting late.

11:12.090 --> 11:14.220
There must be a result for every match.

11:15.120 --> 11:17.550
Tian Ink and Chen Ink—

11:18.030 --> 11:21.510
which deserves to be the Tribute Ink?

11:22.320 --> 11:24.600
Judges, please share your thoughts.

11:24.870 --> 11:27.550
The Round Scented Ink is invaluable,

11:28.210 --> 11:30.810
making it more suited for the Tribute Ink.

11:31.550 --> 11:32.410
I beg to differ.

11:32.630 --> 11:34.000
Tian Ink is too dry.

11:34.150 --> 11:36.000
It is obviously newly made

11:36.150 --> 11:37.810
and needs more time to settle.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.250
In terms of quality,

11:39.600 --> 11:42.840
Chen Ink is certainly better.

11:44.750 --> 11:45.320
Got it.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.550
In this case,

11:47.910 --> 11:49.270
I announce

11:49.840 --> 11:54.080
that the winner
of the Tribute Ink selection is...

11:54.240 --> 11:56.790
Here comes the royal preceptor,
Sage Qing He.

12:01.960 --> 12:05.440
Greetings, respectable sage.

12:08.600 --> 12:11.000
Dispense with the formalities, everyone.

12:11.000 --> 12:13.670
I can't believe
your sudden visit to Huizhou

12:13.750 --> 12:15.470
was completely unknown to me, dear sage.

12:15.470 --> 12:17.550
I deserve severe punishment for it.

12:17.600 --> 12:19.150
While passing by this place,
the sage heard

12:19.150 --> 12:21.960
the winner of the Tribute Ink selection
couldn't be decided after a long time,

12:21.960 --> 12:23.510
so he specially came in
to provide support.

12:23.510 --> 12:26.320
The timing is impeccable, Sage Qing He.

12:26.320 --> 12:28.050
In this Tribute Ink selection,

12:28.320 --> 12:30.440
the Tian and Chen families have presented

12:30.440 --> 12:32.570
nearly equally premier ink products.

12:33.120 --> 12:35.550
Sage, as a companion
to His Majesty for long,

12:35.550 --> 12:38.080
you are highly accomplished
in calligraphy.

12:38.150 --> 12:41.670
Hereby, I boldly invite you
to assess the ink.

12:42.080 --> 12:42.910
Oh you.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.820
You could never handle tasks well

12:44.870 --> 12:46.960
back when you worked
in the imperial palace.

12:46.960 --> 12:47.670
Fine then.

12:47.780 --> 12:49.660
I'll help you with the selection.

12:49.690 --> 12:51.090
Thank you, Sage.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.330
Sage Qing He,

12:54.510 --> 12:56.030
this is Tian Ink.

12:56.600 --> 12:58.510
This is Chen Ink.

13:08.360 --> 13:09.790
Why is there a fly?

13:13.910 --> 13:15.390
This ink is unclean.

13:30.160 --> 13:32.000
The fragrance of Styrax resin.

13:32.790 --> 13:34.440
His Majesty will like it.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.270
In my opinion,

13:36.750 --> 13:37.870
the Tribute Ink

13:38.550 --> 13:39.750
should be Tian Ink.

13:43.260 --> 13:44.010
Sage Qing He,

13:44.510 --> 13:46.570
please take one more look at Chen Ink.

13:46.690 --> 13:48.570
It truly is a fine piece of ink.

13:48.720 --> 13:51.200
Sage, we beg you to check it again.

14:04.080 --> 14:04.910
Sage,

14:04.910 --> 14:07.000
we implore you to reassess Chen Ink.

14:07.080 --> 14:08.540
Sage, we cordially ask you

14:08.810 --> 14:10.140
to make a just decision!

14:16.150 --> 14:18.720
Now that you have given an instruction,
Sage,

14:19.030 --> 14:21.440
I completely agree with your opinion.

14:22.440 --> 14:23.770
Thank you, Sage Qing He.

14:23.960 --> 14:25.240
Thank you, Lord Yan.

14:26.030 --> 14:29.270
The Tian family promises
to meet expectations, produce enough ink,

14:29.270 --> 14:32.000
and deliver it to His Majesty
as soon as possible.

14:40.280 --> 14:42.880
[Zhenbao House] [Chen]

14:46.960 --> 14:47.510
Father.

14:47.960 --> 14:48.600
Father!

14:49.080 --> 14:49.870
Help!

14:58.220 --> 15:04.120
[Literary Association]

15:05.510 --> 15:07.270
[Champion of Ink Making]

15:24.200 --> 15:25.530
Champion of Ink Making.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.450
Champion of Ink Making!

15:29.320 --> 15:31.180
We are the champion of ink making!

15:32.960 --> 15:34.120
From now on,

15:34.550 --> 15:37.200
the Tian family will be marching towards

15:37.510 --> 15:39.510
great prosperity and huge success!

15:41.600 --> 15:42.240
Benchang.

15:42.840 --> 15:43.630
Quickly have

15:43.790 --> 15:45.990
this plaque hung up in our ink workshop.

15:46.480 --> 15:47.080
My love,

15:47.390 --> 15:49.600
prepare a banquet soon.

15:49.870 --> 15:51.240
It's a convention in Hui Ink

15:51.240 --> 15:52.750
for the Ink Affairs Official

15:52.750 --> 15:56.480
to attend a banquet held by the winner
of the Tribute Ink selection.

15:56.550 --> 15:57.750
Do take the matter seriously.

15:57.750 --> 15:59.790
Don't worry, Master.
All is properly arranged.

15:59.790 --> 16:00.600
Really?

16:01.100 --> 16:02.960
The food and wine must be vegetarian.

16:02.960 --> 16:05.160
Because Sage Qing He will attend it too.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.080
Ronghua,

16:09.700 --> 16:11.360
your two brothers have told me

16:11.390 --> 16:14.000
about what happened
in the Literary Association just now.

16:14.000 --> 16:17.000
You are a significant contributor
to the Tian family.

16:17.600 --> 16:18.330
Let's get in.

16:28.150 --> 16:28.840
Ronghua,

16:29.870 --> 16:30.530
take a seat.

16:36.390 --> 16:37.210
No, wait.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.150
Ronghua, have some tea.

16:40.150 --> 16:41.010
Let me serve it.

16:47.890 --> 16:48.490
Ronghua,

16:48.840 --> 16:49.670
have some tea.

16:57.510 --> 16:58.320
Ronghua,

16:58.840 --> 17:00.910
Father and I submitted visiting cards
for several times in the Capital,

17:00.910 --> 17:02.240
seeking an audience with Sage Qing He.

17:02.240 --> 17:03.630
Yet he never agreed to meet us.

17:03.630 --> 17:05.069
How did you make his acquaintance?

17:05.069 --> 17:06.069
Yes, dear sister.

17:06.369 --> 17:09.200
It's said that the sage can even enter
and leave the imperial palace freely.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.829
What an unusual figure.

17:11.540 --> 17:13.750
He has been friends with the Xu family
for a long time.

17:13.750 --> 17:15.200
It was not difficult for me

17:15.200 --> 17:16.660
to meet his acquaintance.

17:21.270 --> 17:22.030
Oh right.

17:24.640 --> 17:27.200
The sage told my fortune
when he first saw me.

17:28.790 --> 17:29.680
He said

17:30.160 --> 17:31.820
that the family I was born into

17:32.680 --> 17:33.940
refused to nurture me.

17:34.960 --> 17:38.360
I am destined to receive little affection
from my own family.

17:39.510 --> 17:40.160
Father,

17:41.550 --> 17:42.160
Mother,

17:45.790 --> 17:46.920
am I right?

17:49.780 --> 17:51.260
Yes, yes.

17:52.400 --> 17:53.240
Ronghua,

17:54.160 --> 17:55.890
we had no choice but to treat you

17:56.160 --> 17:57.790
like that in the past.

17:58.400 --> 18:00.060
We're sorry to have upset you.

18:00.350 --> 18:03.510
If you are not having a good time
in the Xu family,

18:04.160 --> 18:05.960
how about I go and beg Mrs. Hu

18:06.030 --> 18:07.480
to let you come home to us?

18:08.750 --> 18:09.480
Mother,

18:10.160 --> 18:12.420
do you think the Xu family would allow one

18:13.070 --> 18:14.670
to come and go as one pleases?

18:17.680 --> 18:20.010
Although Sage Qing He has made a decision,

18:20.070 --> 18:22.270
it cannot quell the dispute in Huizhou.

18:23.510 --> 18:24.400
Benchang,

18:25.310 --> 18:26.770
you are now in charge of the family.

18:26.770 --> 18:29.100
You are perfectly aware of how this plaque

18:29.220 --> 18:30.250
was attained.

18:31.070 --> 18:33.750
From now on,
please focus on nothing but ink.

18:34.590 --> 18:37.590
First, no mistakes in the important task
of delivering ink to the Capital.

18:37.590 --> 18:40.750
Second, try to be diligent, serious,
and respectful

18:41.680 --> 18:44.080
as you solidify
the foundation of Tian Ink.

18:44.160 --> 18:47.760
Only in this way can the Tian family
enjoy long-term prosperity.

18:50.590 --> 18:51.920
I will keep that in mind.

18:58.920 --> 19:00.180
Little did I expect...

19:01.000 --> 19:03.330
the Tribute Ink selection to end this way.

19:04.270 --> 19:06.000
All my planning over these days

19:06.550 --> 19:09.350
became in vain
as Sage Qing He lightly swept

19:10.200 --> 19:11.510
his whisk.

19:12.990 --> 19:15.190
This time, after returning to Huizhou,

19:15.200 --> 19:17.160
although I've brought down Zhao Shen,

19:17.160 --> 19:19.640
the Tian family has thrived
by using their victory

19:19.640 --> 19:21.510
in the Tribute Ink selection.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.080
Meanwhile, for failing to raise

19:25.110 --> 19:27.110
a military fund of ten thousand taels,

19:27.110 --> 19:29.440
I'll be severely punished by the general.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.750
Now, I am not only going to lose

19:31.750 --> 19:33.030
my position as the master of Yihousheng,

19:33.030 --> 19:34.200
but also

19:35.430 --> 19:36.760
my military post.

19:39.200 --> 19:40.260
That said, Father,

19:41.070 --> 19:41.880
Aunt,

19:42.310 --> 19:43.000
Brother,

19:44.240 --> 19:46.590
I will not give up
until I brush off the dirt

19:47.510 --> 19:48.840
thrown onto your names.

19:59.240 --> 19:59.830
Master.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.510
Is everything ready?

20:07.160 --> 20:08.310
Bills, documents,

20:08.400 --> 20:09.920
and all the ready silver in the account

20:09.920 --> 20:11.120
have been sorted out.

20:13.680 --> 20:16.230
Master, without Yihousheng
and your military post,

20:16.230 --> 20:18.830
what are we going to fight
the Tian family with?

20:21.200 --> 20:23.860
I should've handled this matter
in a better way.

20:23.950 --> 20:25.510
Let's pay a visit to Sister first.

20:25.510 --> 20:26.110
Take this.

20:39.720 --> 20:42.350
It didn't occur to me
even the Chen family would lose.

20:42.350 --> 20:44.050
Despite all the hustle these days,

20:44.050 --> 20:45.790
you still lost your position.

20:48.880 --> 20:49.510
Master.

20:57.720 --> 20:58.960
Wait for me outside.

21:04.510 --> 21:06.590
This is all the ready silver
in Yihousheng's account.

21:06.590 --> 21:08.270
Fifteen hundred taels in total.

21:08.270 --> 21:10.350
These are all the bills of my investments

21:10.350 --> 21:11.920
in the ink industry using military funds

21:11.920 --> 21:13.550
since I arrived in Huizhou,

21:13.790 --> 21:16.350
including contracts
with the Li Ink Workshop

21:16.920 --> 21:20.320
and details of dividends
from the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

21:21.200 --> 21:21.830
Oh, right.

21:23.310 --> 21:25.640
The most valuable thing right now

21:26.110 --> 21:29.040
should be this contract
with the New Li Ink Workshop.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.310
It is an agreement

21:31.510 --> 21:34.110
on splitting dividends from Fu Jin Ink.

21:35.590 --> 21:37.750
All of these contracts add up to about

21:38.270 --> 21:39.400
2,500 taels.

21:40.240 --> 21:42.350
The total dividends in two or three months

21:42.350 --> 21:43.790
should be around 2,000 taels.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.550
Altogether, the value is 6,000 taels.

21:45.550 --> 21:48.000
As for the 1,000 taels
invested in the Chen family,

21:48.000 --> 21:49.830
I suppose it'll double in profit.

21:49.830 --> 21:52.110
You've settled everything
about Yihousheng.

21:52.110 --> 21:54.240
Then what about you? What's your plan?

21:59.590 --> 22:01.190
I haven't figured it out yet.

22:02.510 --> 22:03.960
Listen,

22:04.270 --> 22:06.400
the Tian family is at its peak now.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.200
You cannot take any risks.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.440
The Tian family is at its peak...

22:14.270 --> 22:15.510
Don't worry, Sister.

22:15.750 --> 22:17.640
I won't take any risks.

22:19.680 --> 22:20.790
Even if I don't think about myself,

22:20.790 --> 22:22.790
I'll have to think about Marshal Qi.

22:24.790 --> 22:26.480
I am deeply indebted to him.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.920
How can I ever implicate him

22:29.240 --> 22:30.440
for my own interests?

22:34.000 --> 22:36.760
Since there's nothing left
for you at this place,

22:37.750 --> 22:40.550
why not go back to Marshal Qi
and seek a fresh start?

22:45.960 --> 22:47.440
At this point,

22:48.000 --> 22:49.400
how can I show my face

22:50.350 --> 22:51.610
in front of Marshal Qi?

22:53.830 --> 22:55.960
Although I haven't figured out a plan,

22:57.070 --> 22:58.480
I won't leave Huizhou anyway.

22:58.480 --> 22:59.810
I'm not going anywhere.

23:00.340 --> 23:01.470
Then how about this?

23:01.550 --> 23:02.880
I'll ask Zhen for a favor.

23:02.880 --> 23:03.240
Sister.

23:03.240 --> 23:04.270
She could help you settle.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.030
Sister!

23:07.880 --> 23:09.340
Please be seated, Sister.

23:16.310 --> 23:17.790
It's my own business to figure out

23:17.790 --> 23:19.000
a way to in Huizhou.

23:19.880 --> 23:21.160
Since it's my personal matter,

23:21.160 --> 23:22.830
I'd like to keep Zhen out of it.

23:22.830 --> 23:24.750
I'd hate to get her in any danger.

23:24.920 --> 23:27.000
So, if you still see me as a brother,

23:27.110 --> 23:28.030
Sister, please

23:29.070 --> 23:30.530
don't go ask Zhen for help,

23:31.030 --> 23:32.920
or bring this matter up again.

24:07.550 --> 24:09.680
You seem to be in a good mood, Master Qi.

24:16.310 --> 24:16.920
Zhen,

24:16.920 --> 24:19.110
since you took over Li Ink,

24:19.200 --> 24:20.730
you've been busy with work.

24:22.160 --> 24:24.110
How did you find time to come here?

24:24.880 --> 24:25.880
Just like you,

24:26.070 --> 24:28.530
I need my own leisure time
every now and then.

24:30.590 --> 24:32.520
I have a bit more of that than you do.

24:32.550 --> 24:35.070
I have been idling the entire day.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.590
It seems...

24:40.400 --> 24:41.930
my sister has talked to you.

24:43.880 --> 24:45.720
She's only looking out for you.

24:49.310 --> 24:50.880
As my grandfather once said,

24:50.880 --> 24:53.110
life is all about ups and downs.

24:53.750 --> 24:56.210
Everyone's fortune differs.

24:57.000 --> 24:59.000
A temporary setback means nothing.

24:59.030 --> 24:59.960
Take me as an example.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.480
I was expelled from the clan before,

25:01.480 --> 25:03.790
but now I am in charge of Li Ink.

25:04.270 --> 25:05.440
In my opinion,

25:05.680 --> 25:08.830
as long as one has a bite to eat
and some strength left,

25:09.070 --> 25:11.070
one can always achieve one's goals.

25:14.000 --> 25:17.030
Thank you for comforting me, Zhen.

25:18.480 --> 25:19.350
That said,

25:20.590 --> 25:23.000
just pretend
you don't know about my difficulties.

25:23.000 --> 25:24.830
How can I pretend not to know?

25:25.680 --> 25:27.880
Part of the credit
of creating the Origin Ink goes to you.

25:27.880 --> 25:30.680
I can't sit back and do nothing
when you're in adversity.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.720
Besides,

25:31.790 --> 25:33.850
you're a major shareholder of Li Ink.

25:34.070 --> 25:35.480
If you don't mind,

25:36.000 --> 25:37.460
come work in Li Ink with me.

25:37.920 --> 25:38.750
I assure you

25:38.960 --> 25:40.030
that as long as I'm around,

25:40.030 --> 25:42.360
you'll have food to eat
and a place to stay.

25:48.830 --> 25:50.590
Although I am down and out now,

25:50.590 --> 25:53.000
I can still build something up

25:53.000 --> 25:54.830
with my own hands.

25:55.400 --> 25:57.920
So, making a living
won't be a problem for me.

26:02.070 --> 26:04.590
You're not concerned
about your livelihood.

26:04.590 --> 26:06.270
But what about your rumbling stomach?

26:06.270 --> 26:08.130
It's a problem to solve, isn't it?

26:09.240 --> 26:11.040
Fine. Let's have it sorted then.

26:11.980 --> 26:13.180
In which restaurant?

26:24.310 --> 26:25.240
Master Qi,

26:26.270 --> 26:28.000
it's a simle home-cooked meal.

26:28.070 --> 26:29.930
If there's anything inadequate,

26:30.400 --> 26:31.460
please forgive us.

26:31.480 --> 26:33.200
Eighth Master Li, how nice of you.

26:33.200 --> 26:36.160
I took the liberty of calling on you
but you didn't turn me away.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.820
I'm already deeply grateful.

26:38.230 --> 26:38.950
Master Qi,

26:39.320 --> 26:40.880
just make yourself at home.

26:40.910 --> 26:42.310
Don't stand on ceremony.

26:44.350 --> 26:44.880
Eat up.

26:44.900 --> 26:45.380
Dig in.

26:47.350 --> 26:47.960
Let's eat.

26:56.070 --> 26:57.640
Zhengliang. Zhengliang!

26:57.640 --> 26:59.070
Quick, bring a jar of wine over.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.000
Some bowls, too!

27:00.080 --> 27:00.600
Got it!

27:00.620 --> 27:02.230
Here comes the chicken soup.

27:03.350 --> 27:04.280
Here's the soup.

27:05.790 --> 27:06.920
Fetch some bowls now.

27:06.920 --> 27:08.320
I'll go get some, Mother.

27:09.240 --> 27:09.920
Eat up.

27:09.960 --> 27:11.070
Have some more.

27:14.440 --> 27:17.000
Master Qi, you're a rare guest for us.

27:17.200 --> 27:19.830
Make sure you have enough drinks
and enjoy them tonight.

27:19.830 --> 27:20.310
Sure.

27:20.400 --> 27:23.000
Come on, let me make a toast to you first.

27:23.200 --> 27:23.510
Here.

27:23.510 --> 27:24.570
Thank you, Auntie.

27:27.160 --> 27:28.240
Alright, enough.

27:28.830 --> 27:29.890
Do enjoy yourself.

27:34.590 --> 27:36.000
You can really hold your liquor,
Master Qi.

27:36.000 --> 27:38.110
Quick, fill Master Qi's bowl.

27:38.160 --> 27:38.880
Let me help.

27:39.000 --> 27:40.960
Mother, you're supposed
to entertain the guest,

27:40.960 --> 27:42.200
not to get him drunk.

27:43.440 --> 27:44.740
It's a good thing for him to get drunk,

27:44.740 --> 27:47.000
so he could drown all his sorrows in wine.

27:47.030 --> 27:47.790
Once you're drunk,

27:47.790 --> 27:50.120
you'll forget everything bothering you!

27:50.440 --> 27:51.110
Come on.

27:51.270 --> 27:53.200
Let's all propose a toast to Master Qi.

27:53.200 --> 27:53.550
Come on.

27:53.550 --> 27:54.590
Just be seated.

27:56.350 --> 27:57.350
Eighth Master Li.

27:59.270 --> 27:59.730
Come on.

27:59.750 --> 28:00.950
Don't drink too much.

28:01.680 --> 28:02.540
No, drink more.

28:03.480 --> 28:04.270
Zhen,

28:04.720 --> 28:06.640
I just learned to make this dish.

28:06.720 --> 28:07.510
Have a try.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.310
See if I've picked up
Mother's cooking skills.

28:09.310 --> 28:09.790
Sure.

28:10.510 --> 28:11.310
Let me try it.

28:12.640 --> 28:14.310
As Zhen's elder brother,

28:14.550 --> 28:15.960
how could you not let her try it first?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.790
Seriously, you giant turnip,

28:17.920 --> 28:19.790
don't you know to serve the guest first?

28:19.790 --> 28:20.790
Here you are, Master Qi.

28:20.790 --> 28:22.510
Try my sister-in-law's cooking.

28:22.510 --> 28:23.160
Thank you, Zhen.

28:23.160 --> 28:24.090
You're welcome.

28:24.640 --> 28:25.350
Grandpa.

28:27.960 --> 28:29.220
Mother, eat some more.

28:29.310 --> 28:30.110
Thank you, Zhen.

28:30.110 --> 28:31.110
Easy on the drink.

28:32.030 --> 28:33.890
You giant turnip, help yourself.

28:34.830 --> 28:36.920
We're with a guest. Stop calling me that.

28:36.920 --> 28:38.400
Taste it now. See if it's good.

28:38.400 --> 28:38.920
Sure.

28:38.920 --> 28:40.640
I thought it was cooked by Mother.

28:40.640 --> 28:43.240
Qiu'e has really got the essence
of my cooking.

28:43.510 --> 28:44.510
Qiu'e's cooking is amazing.

28:44.510 --> 28:47.070
I've never cared about rules,

28:47.680 --> 28:50.070
but I still made Luo Ink into Tribute Ink.

28:50.270 --> 28:51.350
You should be the same.

28:51.350 --> 28:53.750
Ignore those family rules and principles.

28:54.160 --> 28:56.550
Just do what you want with all your heart.

28:56.880 --> 28:57.920
One day,

28:58.240 --> 29:00.240
I will make Luo Ink

29:00.240 --> 29:01.920
the best of Hui Ink.

29:02.790 --> 29:05.310
If you really grow into a business
in the future,

29:05.310 --> 29:06.550
then help me

29:06.830 --> 29:10.030
open Luo Ink shops all over the world.

29:10.590 --> 29:11.830
Deal?

29:12.270 --> 29:13.240
Deal.

29:14.360 --> 29:15.110
Have some more.

29:15.110 --> 29:15.750
So tasty.

29:18.860 --> 29:21.230
Scram before I change my mind!

29:21.250 --> 29:21.940
Don't!

29:22.000 --> 29:23.400
I'm leaving. Alright?

29:23.400 --> 29:24.110
Let's go.

29:40.880 --> 29:41.590
Eat up.

29:42.590 --> 29:43.850
One more piece for you.

29:52.240 --> 29:54.400
A toast to you, Eighth Master Li.

30:08.920 --> 30:09.510
Auntie.

30:10.290 --> 30:10.960
A toast to you too.

30:10.960 --> 30:11.630
Sure.

30:12.240 --> 30:12.920
Here.

30:27.110 --> 30:27.790
Zhen.

30:29.070 --> 30:29.590
Come on.

30:29.590 --> 30:30.390
A toast to you.

30:41.550 --> 30:42.480
A refill for you.

30:42.720 --> 30:43.920
Thanks, Zhengliang.

30:46.270 --> 30:48.640
Qiu'e, a toast to you as well.

30:49.070 --> 30:50.070
Easy on the drink.

30:54.200 --> 30:55.920
Zhengliang, a toast to you.

30:55.920 --> 30:57.250
Alright. Don't gulp it.

30:59.270 --> 31:00.730
I am very envious of Li Zhen

31:01.510 --> 31:02.970
having a brother like you.

31:13.000 --> 31:14.330
Nice and slow. You good?

31:14.640 --> 31:16.310
Yes, I'm good.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.110
Careful. Mind your steps!

31:18.110 --> 31:18.920
Got it!

31:19.200 --> 31:19.960
Let's go.

31:23.220 --> 31:24.130
Where am I?

31:24.160 --> 31:25.070
On the way home.

31:25.550 --> 31:26.080
Let's go.

31:26.550 --> 31:27.200
Home?

31:27.200 --> 31:28.200
Be good and go with me.

31:28.200 --> 31:29.640
No, I'm not going home.

31:29.750 --> 31:30.720
My home is right here.

31:30.720 --> 31:31.400
No, no, no.

31:31.400 --> 31:32.600
Your home is not here.

31:35.000 --> 31:36.200
My home is right here.

31:36.790 --> 31:37.830
This isn't your home.

31:37.830 --> 31:38.960
This is my home.

31:39.440 --> 31:41.920
Listen, I have a brother at home.

31:42.920 --> 31:44.400
As long as he's around...

31:46.030 --> 31:47.310
I won't be deserted.

31:47.480 --> 31:49.200
Sure, you won't be deserted.

31:49.200 --> 31:49.880
Brother,

31:50.160 --> 31:51.270
I'm heading to the second floor.

31:51.270 --> 31:52.350
No, not the second floor!

31:52.350 --> 31:53.880
Yes, just the second floor.

31:54.160 --> 31:55.350
Please go with me.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.550
You can't desert me...

31:58.030 --> 31:59.720
I won't. I won't.

32:00.480 --> 32:02.310
Zhen, how to deal with this?

32:41.450 --> 32:43.250
I see you've woken up, Master Qi.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.750
Zhen, yesterday,

32:49.560 --> 32:50.950
I caused you so much trouble.

32:50.950 --> 32:51.680
I'm so sorry.

32:52.110 --> 32:52.790
Goodbye.

32:53.200 --> 32:54.330
Where are you going?

32:57.680 --> 32:58.350
To work.

32:58.550 --> 32:59.830
To work where?

33:01.020 --> 33:03.200
A shareholder has become
a long-term employee.

33:03.200 --> 33:05.530
I'm heading to work
in the Li Ink Workshop.

33:06.680 --> 33:07.350
Goodbye.

33:10.550 --> 33:11.920
Pull the door inward.

33:21.780 --> 33:25.700
[Misty Rain]

33:29.000 --> 33:31.790
The ink workshop hasn't yielded
any profits these past few months.

33:31.790 --> 33:33.920
We cannot afford to hire workers,

33:34.350 --> 33:35.810
so we'll have to let our own

33:35.910 --> 33:37.840
ink makers to repair the workshop.

33:43.160 --> 33:44.960
I'm sorry for the terrible thing

33:45.070 --> 33:46.670
I did to you and the Li family.

33:46.790 --> 33:48.030
I shouldn't have set that fire and...

33:48.030 --> 33:49.200
Forget about that, Uncle Jingdong.

33:49.200 --> 33:52.060
It's all in the past now.
Let's not bring it up again.

33:53.160 --> 33:54.030
Manager Shao,

33:54.110 --> 33:56.160
when is the repair
scheduled to be completed?

33:56.160 --> 33:57.680
In about half a year.

33:59.160 --> 34:01.000
That won't do. It's too long.

34:01.470 --> 34:02.960
It'll cause loss of regular clients

34:02.960 --> 34:04.680
and reduce the morale of our employees.

34:04.680 --> 34:07.410
Even the ink workshop
will have to be closed down.

34:09.780 --> 34:12.840
We must figure out a way
to have the repair done quicker.

34:16.800 --> 34:19.199
You want to sell
the Li family's farmlands?

34:19.920 --> 34:21.150
In your dreams!

34:22.670 --> 34:25.070
I'm not selling them, but mortgaging them.

34:25.670 --> 34:26.920
The slow repair of the ink workshop

34:26.920 --> 34:28.920
is entirely due to the lack of money.

34:29.370 --> 34:31.699
Only by mortgaging the farmlands for cash

34:31.710 --> 34:34.590
can we speed up the reconstruction
and resume production soon.

34:34.590 --> 34:36.630
Sister-in-law, Jiangyue,

34:37.290 --> 34:39.820
Zhen and I have discussed this idea.

34:40.590 --> 34:42.070
Although it's a bit risky,

34:42.280 --> 34:43.030
this is

34:43.440 --> 34:45.960
the only feasible solution at present.

34:47.480 --> 34:49.739
You two are really backing each other up.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.110
The ink workshop surely matters.

34:52.110 --> 34:53.920
But don't the lives of these many people

34:53.920 --> 34:55.449
in the mansion also matter?

34:56.400 --> 34:57.330
Sister-in-law,

34:57.670 --> 34:59.110
please say something.

34:59.320 --> 35:01.510
You know the family finances best.

35:01.670 --> 35:03.440
The whole family's daily expenses

35:03.440 --> 35:06.370
all depend on the revenue
of our farmlands and shops.

35:06.590 --> 35:08.000
If they are mortgaged,

35:08.630 --> 35:10.800
how are we going to live?

35:10.960 --> 35:11.800
Jiangyue,

35:12.150 --> 35:14.480
I understand your concerns.

35:15.110 --> 35:17.770
But the ink workshop is in trouble now,
isn't it?

35:17.920 --> 35:19.150
As you just heard,

35:19.150 --> 35:21.150
this is the only feasible solution.

35:22.030 --> 35:24.360
We women at home can't help with much.

35:24.620 --> 35:28.220
The least we can do is tighten our belts
for a few days.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.770
Things will get better.

35:29.920 --> 35:32.120
Ever since I married into the Li family,

35:32.920 --> 35:33.800
the foundation

35:34.230 --> 35:35.280
of the household

35:35.590 --> 35:38.190
has never been touched
in whatever adversity.

35:38.320 --> 35:39.590
How come disasters have kept

35:39.590 --> 35:41.150
befalling us and shortfalls worsening

35:41.150 --> 35:42.610
after this girl's return?

35:43.110 --> 35:44.190
I'm telling you,

35:44.590 --> 35:46.760
I reject this plan!

35:47.070 --> 35:48.280
Fourth Aunt,

35:48.680 --> 35:50.120
once we sign new orders,

35:50.150 --> 35:52.170
new cash flow will naturally follow.

35:52.170 --> 35:54.580
At the latest, we'll redeem the farmlands

35:55.000 --> 35:57.150
when the ink workshop is rebuilt.

35:57.360 --> 35:59.920
Otherwise, if Li Ink really collapses,

36:00.030 --> 36:02.550
though we can rely on the family's
farmlands and properties,

36:02.550 --> 36:03.400
our lives

36:03.840 --> 36:05.370
won't be much comfortable.

36:05.710 --> 36:07.970
I've truly underestimated you, Li Zhen.

36:08.330 --> 36:09.450
I thought you just

36:09.480 --> 36:11.540
wanted to take over the ink workshop.

36:11.550 --> 36:13.760
Little did I imagine
you could be this ruthless.

36:13.760 --> 36:15.190
You're actually exploiting

36:15.190 --> 36:17.320
the family's hardship
to drain all our wealth!

36:17.320 --> 36:18.030
Jiangyue,

36:18.280 --> 36:19.400
today,

36:19.760 --> 36:21.510
all those who can decide for the Li family

36:21.510 --> 36:22.570
are gathered here.

36:23.210 --> 36:25.620
Since our opinions differ,

36:26.230 --> 36:27.070
we should

36:27.710 --> 36:30.110
let Wanyi have the final say
on this matter.

36:35.030 --> 36:36.800
I agree with Zhen's proposal.

36:38.670 --> 36:40.000
Then it's settled.

36:41.070 --> 36:42.510
You already decided everything.

36:42.510 --> 36:44.280
Why did you even ask me
to come discuss it?

36:44.280 --> 36:46.030
You're all in cahoots

36:46.320 --> 36:48.070
to drive the Li family to ruin!

36:52.270 --> 36:54.750
[Changsheng Garden]

36:53.630 --> 36:54.670
Master Tian,

36:55.480 --> 36:56.880
what a magnificent manor

36:57.170 --> 36:58.560
you have.

36:59.650 --> 37:02.650
It is no inferior to the noble's houses
in the Capital.

37:04.280 --> 37:07.030
Everything here
is unpresentable and vulgar.

37:07.550 --> 37:10.230
The presence of you and Lord Yan here

37:10.510 --> 37:11.760
has really

37:12.190 --> 37:14.320
brought light to our humble dwelling.

37:14.920 --> 37:15.980
Cheers, everyone.

37:20.760 --> 37:21.550
Bingyou.

37:22.590 --> 37:25.150
The ink industry in Huizhou is prosperous,

37:25.710 --> 37:27.440
and the ink merchants wealthy.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.960
It means that you're doing your job well

37:29.960 --> 37:31.560
as the Ink Affairs Official.

37:32.330 --> 37:33.760
When Ronghua and I deliver

37:33.760 --> 37:36.000
the Tribute Ink to the Capital
and meet His Majesty,

37:36.000 --> 37:38.730
we will surely report
your good work faithfully.

37:40.320 --> 37:42.840
Thank you so much, Sage.

37:42.880 --> 37:45.030
I feel utterly grateful.

37:46.460 --> 37:47.170
Sage,

37:47.480 --> 37:49.230
Ronghua hasn't been home for a long time.

37:49.230 --> 37:52.360
She didn't get to spend much time
with our parents during this visit.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.880
Please let her stay here
for a few more days.

37:53.880 --> 37:56.550
I can deliver the ink to the Capital
in her stead.

37:56.550 --> 37:58.480
How considerate of you, Benchang.

37:59.190 --> 38:02.190
However, Aunt is urging me to go back.

38:02.670 --> 38:05.030
I couldn't stay here even if I wanted to.

38:05.440 --> 38:07.190
Since Benchang took charge of Tian Ink,

38:07.190 --> 38:09.760
he's been handling everything personally
and working day and night.

38:09.760 --> 38:12.110
All matters big and small
in the ink workshop

38:12.110 --> 38:13.710
is taken care of by him alone.

38:14.320 --> 38:15.510
On my way back to the Capital,

38:15.510 --> 38:17.510
I can also deliver the Tribute Ink.

38:17.920 --> 38:19.050
This way, Benchang,

38:19.550 --> 38:22.080
you'll be spared
from an exhausting journey.

38:22.480 --> 38:23.400
Ronghua,

38:24.630 --> 38:26.710
I'm in charge of Tian Ink now.

38:27.190 --> 38:28.960
The delivery is part of my duty.

38:31.880 --> 38:34.760
We are with the sage,
a distinguished guest, right now.

38:34.760 --> 38:36.630
Ronghua is busy with her stuff.

38:36.880 --> 38:39.320
Why not let Benchang
deliver the ink instead?

38:39.320 --> 38:40.320
That said,

38:41.040 --> 38:43.570
Benchang has things to do
in the ink workshop.

38:43.760 --> 38:44.620
How about this?

38:45.440 --> 38:48.240
I've been the one
dealing with Tian Ink's clients.

38:48.590 --> 38:50.590
I am also familiar with the Capital.

38:50.850 --> 38:53.050
Why not let me deliver the ink this time?

39:01.110 --> 39:03.550
Huizhou is truly a blessed land.

39:04.670 --> 39:07.070
Everyone born and raised here is smart.

39:10.000 --> 39:10.920
Benchang.

39:12.280 --> 39:13.590
In my opinion,

39:13.800 --> 39:16.170
your sister handles everything properly.

39:16.170 --> 39:19.630
I think she should be the one delivering
the ink to the Capital.

39:22.880 --> 39:24.360
Sure, Sage Qing He.

39:36.320 --> 39:37.030
Bingyou.

39:38.840 --> 39:41.360
I have a few more words to say
to the Tian family.

39:41.360 --> 39:42.440
You may leave now.

39:43.020 --> 39:45.010
Got it. I'll be leaving then.

39:47.230 --> 39:48.860
Everything hinges on you now, Sage.

39:48.860 --> 39:51.410
I will be awaiting good news.

40:00.920 --> 40:01.670
Sage,

40:01.670 --> 40:03.730
this is a small gift prepared for you.

40:09.030 --> 40:10.960
Such rootless stuff is unclean.

40:10.960 --> 40:12.110
Take it away now.

40:12.230 --> 40:13.800
It's offending my sight.

40:16.360 --> 40:17.150
Benchang,

40:17.760 --> 40:19.770
the sage has devoted himself
to serving immortals.

40:19.770 --> 40:22.840
His hands are not to sullied
with such lowly earthly things

40:22.840 --> 40:24.570
handled by nameless nobodies.

40:24.730 --> 40:26.370
Ronghua truly knows me well.

40:26.830 --> 40:28.760
I heard the previous County Magistrate

40:28.760 --> 40:31.030
of this place was just found guilty.

40:31.550 --> 40:33.590
Your household
is in need of an accountant.

40:33.590 --> 40:36.590
It's all because they touched things
they shouldn't have.

40:36.590 --> 40:39.070
Tian Ink just won
the latest Tribute Ink selection,

40:39.070 --> 40:42.670
Many eyes are on you lot now,
in secret or openly.

40:42.880 --> 40:45.110
I was just about to remind you

40:45.360 --> 40:47.020
of being cautious in every way

40:47.110 --> 40:49.670
so as not to let anyone find anything
to hold against you

40:49.670 --> 40:51.400
and slander me with.

40:52.630 --> 40:53.360
Yes.

40:53.940 --> 40:55.470
Sage, you're a noble being.

40:55.510 --> 40:57.170
I shouldn't have been so rude.

41:02.040 --> 41:03.490
[Styrax Ink]

41:02.910 --> 41:03.830
Ronghua,

41:04.590 --> 41:06.510
I cast a divination today.

41:08.190 --> 41:10.000
The hexagram was very bad.

41:10.110 --> 41:11.070
Sage,

41:11.360 --> 41:14.070
should the ink be improved in any way?

41:14.390 --> 41:15.280
This ink

41:16.000 --> 41:18.070
is almost perfect.

41:18.960 --> 41:20.320
But Styrax resin

41:20.990 --> 41:22.600
is from Nanyang after all.

41:23.150 --> 41:25.670
It's not a domestic product.

41:26.280 --> 41:29.150
Writing ritual poems
for the Three Supreme Deities

41:30.330 --> 41:31.730
is a bit inappropriate.

41:32.750 --> 41:34.150
Then what should be done?

41:34.320 --> 41:37.920
The ink used for ritual poems directly
connects us to immortals.

41:38.190 --> 41:39.630
The best choice is surely

41:40.030 --> 41:43.800
pine soot ink
made from century-old pine timber.

41:44.280 --> 41:47.150
Top-grade pine soot ink is said to be
extremely precious

41:47.150 --> 41:50.440
and even worth a thousand taels of gold
in the Capital.

41:52.550 --> 41:54.800
But don't worry, Master Tian.

41:55.840 --> 41:58.550
Everything on this precious land is great.

41:58.800 --> 42:01.400
You can collect
top-grade pine timber locally

42:01.430 --> 42:02.830
to produce pine soot ink,

42:03.070 --> 42:06.630
with which I'll set up an altar
to pray for the people through rituals.

42:06.630 --> 42:08.150
Sage, you may not know

42:08.670 --> 42:11.590
that there's a serious outbreak
of pine wilt disease in Huizhou.

42:11.590 --> 42:13.440
Let alone century-old pine timber,

42:13.440 --> 42:15.000
even ordinary pine timber

42:15.110 --> 42:16.640
is hard to find at this time.

42:17.630 --> 42:18.760
Pine wilt disease?

42:19.400 --> 42:20.280
Exactly.

42:21.110 --> 42:23.550
To add to that, this disease is incurable.

42:23.590 --> 42:25.280
Now many ink workshops in Huizhou

42:25.280 --> 42:27.070
are using tung oil to make ink instead.

42:27.070 --> 42:28.070
I think this is why

42:28.070 --> 42:30.550
pine soot ink is so expensive
in the Capital.

42:30.880 --> 42:32.750
No wonder the divination today

42:33.110 --> 42:35.310
shows I lack the Wood element this year.

42:36.220 --> 42:37.680
You lack the Wood element?

42:40.400 --> 42:41.320
Sage,

42:41.670 --> 42:42.710
how about

42:42.710 --> 42:44.970
I accompany you to Mount Qiyun tomorrow?

42:45.150 --> 42:47.760
There stands
a thousand-year-old ginkgo tree.

42:47.760 --> 42:50.000
The leaves are turning gold at this time.

42:50.000 --> 42:52.800
Maybe we can share its luck and longevity.

42:55.510 --> 42:56.510
Sounds nice!

42:56.920 --> 42:58.400
You're such a good child.

43:00.000 --> 43:00.760
Great.

43:01.630 --> 43:02.400
Great idea!
